  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#10877;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#10877;</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>For intersection point:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#968;</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math>, so&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#968;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#968;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#968;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0062_ddbdaab88652.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 251px;\" /></p><p>Required area is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>&#968;</mi><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>&#968;</mi><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>(</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#968;</mi><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#968;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#968;</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;sq. units</p>"
